==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|а ка́к же}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Lvova-а как же.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{compound|ru|а|как|же|t1=and|t2=how|t3=emphatic/protesting particle}} with {{glossary|ellipsis}} of {{m|ru|ина́че||otherwise}}, i.e. "how else?".

====Adverb====
{{ru-adv|[[а]] [[ка́к]] [[же]]}}

# [[sure]]!, [[of course]]!

===Etymology 2===
Same as above, but with no ellipsis.

====Adverb====
{{ru-adv|[[а]] [[ка́к]] [[же]]}}

# [[what about]], [[how about]]? {{q|used to ask someone to consider something or someone that they apparently have not considered}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''А ка́к же''' [[обе́д]]?|What about the dinner {{q|have you forgotten}}?}}
